{
  "@id": "scene.pre_timeline",
  "scene_id": "scene.pre_timeline",
  "@where": "Book 0 Pre Sundering before the sundering",
  "@source": "Book 0 Pre Sundering before the sundering/Pre timeline.md",
  "=segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": ".",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "CHAPTER 0 — THE PRE-SUNDering COSMOS",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "(Codified from your narration; gaps marked where you want insertable numbers or refinements)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "0.0 Before Planets Had Names — The Local Proto-Galaxy",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Before Earth, before Tiamat, before Mars was scarred red, the local system wasn’t a “solar system.”\nIt was a Graviton-managed lattice of half-materialized worlds:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Neptune (proto-form)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Mars (green-world seed)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Saturn (central node)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Pluto (outer anchor)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Several unnamed Gambit-substrates — proto-planetoids in flux.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "These worlds weren’t “planets” the way we know them.\nThey were multi-existent bodies, partially in:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "1. baseline matter",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "2. void-space",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "3. a pre-ethereal phase-state the Gravitons alone understood.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "This is why the Void Spiers worked.\nThey were built across all three layers simultaneously.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "0.1 The Void Spiers — Graviton Infrastructure",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "The Gravitons erected Void Spiers on every planetary candidate they planned to solidify.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "A Void Spire was:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "not fully 3D",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "not fully void",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "not fully ethereal",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "but anchored to all three",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "They were interstellar elevators before “space” even stabilized.\nYou didn’t fly between worlds — you shifted between layers of existence.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "The Gravitons intended them as colony highways for when the system finished “cohering.”",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "It never got that far.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "0.2 The Aeon Keepers Step In — Chaos→Vrill",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "The Gravitons built the infrastructure, but didn’t finish the job.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Chaos multiplied faster than they could regulate it.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "So another faction stepped forward:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "The Aeon Keepers.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Not creators.\nNot gods.\nArchivists of equilibrium.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "They took:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "raw chaos",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "raw void\n…and crushed it into vrill through compression rituals older than memory.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Vrill is what allowed:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "stability",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "predictability",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "sequence",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "cause and effect",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "entangled co-realities to stop collapsing",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "With vrill, the Aeon Keepers forged The Veil — a membrane between:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "1. Material",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "2. Ethereal",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "3. Void",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "…and this triad produced the Ethereal Realm as a stable overlay.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "This is the true beginning of magic as a system.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "0.3 The Hidden Fourth Layer — Veil, Ethereal, Void, Vrill",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Your cosmology isn’t binary. It’s tetradic:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "The Veil (membrane)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "The Ethereal (reflection)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "The Void (absence)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Vrill (condensed pattern-energy)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Four denominations.\nFour currencies.\nFour conflicts.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "The Aeon Keepers maintained balance.\nThe Gravitons maintained infrastructure.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "And then the Gravitons walked off the stage.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "0.4 The Departure of the Gravitons — Saturn Leaves",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "The Gravitons never incarnated into biological humanoids.\nThey were always “adjacent beings” — present but unfixed.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Yet humanoid forms did exist in the system in this era.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "When the Gravitons saw the chaos cycles spiraling out of regulation, they left.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "They took:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "their archives",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "their keys",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "and Saturn itself, their central node.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "The moment Saturn vanished:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "The lattice collapsed",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Light sequences destabilized",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "The local system dimmed",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "“The Darkness” moved in to reclaim the region",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "This was the first cosmic blackout.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Later cultures would call it “The Sundering Before the Sundering.”",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "0.5 The Temporal Agency & the Veyronic Pattern",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "The Temporal Agency already existed — a multi-realm organization monitoring:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "parallel timelines",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "coexistent layers",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "branching futures",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "vrill patterns",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "collapses",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "When the Gravitons departed, reality began fraying.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "The Temporal Agency synthesized the Veyronic Pattern\n(check your final name: Veyronic / Vayronic / Vehronic / Veironic)\n—a stabilizing temporal lattice that can:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "hold open portals",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "synchronize divergent timelines",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "resist entropy",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "This is the knowledge the Queen wanted.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "This is the pattern the Temporal Guardian protected.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "0.6 The Hunt for the Temporal Guardian",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "The Annunaki arrived immediately, like wolves scenting blood.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "While the Gravitons ignored the threat, the Annunaki did not.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "They wanted:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "the Pattern",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "the timing keys",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "dominion over the Veil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "They chased the Temporal Guardian, leader of the Agency, across collapsing timelines.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "As the Void Spiers shut down one by one, he used the Veyronic Pattern to:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "hold the last gate open",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "evacuate his colony",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "deny the Queen access",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "jump through the collapsing gate",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "But the jump fractured him:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "He split into three temporal shards, scattered across space and time.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "This is the Viên-triad precursor.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "The Queen unleashed The Blood Curse afterward — a recursive hunting mechanism locked to his signature.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "0.7 After the Gravitons — The Aeon Keepers Take Command",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "With the Gravitons gone and the Temporal Guardian missing, the Aeon Keepers stepped up.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "They built the Akashic Library.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Not a metaphor.\nNot a storage device.\nA living multidimensional recorder that:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "maps reality",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "logs timeline collapses",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "stores planetary history from the moment it forms",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "stabilizes vrill",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "interfaces with Nehereti conduits",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "They became not just keepers of balance — they became the memory of the galaxy.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "0.8 The Queen’s Orbit — The Forgotten Epoch",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "This is the lost era you’re trying to lock numbers into.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "The Queen entered a cyclical orbit around the proto-galaxy.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Why?",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "To map:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "planetary drift",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "void tides",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "vrill upwellings",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "star alignments",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "ethereal ripples",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "debris flows",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "potential colony seeds",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "But the duration is unknown.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "This is the Blank Record Period in the Akashic Library.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Insert your date range here:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "> (insert years_or_cycles_unk_here)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "This is intentional — it creates mythic uncertainty.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "0.9 The Creation of Tiamat — The First Written Record",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Eventually the Aeon Keepers grew tired of being archivists.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "They wanted life, not logs.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Using:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "samples from green-world Mars",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "their own thought-forms",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "vrill as scaffolding",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "…they created:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Tiamat — the water planet",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "The Nehereti — light/dark friction beings",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "The Pelagor — ancient aquatic organics",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "This event marks the first official entry in the Akashic Library.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Insert your timestamp:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "> (insert first_documented_year_here)",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "This era was peaceful.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Until the Queen made her move.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "0.10 The Arrival of Marduk — The System Breaks",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "The Queen finally maneuvered her influence into place.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Enter Marduk, carrying one of his shepherd moons.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Impact.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Shattering.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Tiamat dies",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Earth is born",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "The debris becomes the Asteroid Belt",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Mars is wounded and bleeds its atmosphere",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "The old vrill flows rupture",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "The Akashic Library surges",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "The Nehereti flee",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "The Galaxy enters the first true Dawn of War",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "And that’s where your known history begins.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "---",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "If you want, I can now generate:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "A) A ZW-ready .zw block for CH0 with IDs, types, and fields",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "B) A ZON 4D version with @when / @where / @delta",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "C) A clean narrative chapter for your novel",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "D) A lore-database entry for MrLore to ingest",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "E) A timeline map with placeholders for your missing dates",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "F) A “Temporal Guardian × 3-Shard Model” sheet",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Just tell me which one you want next.",
      "type": "narration"
    }
  ],
